mse version: 2.0.0
short name: Setsmith alias bar
full name: Setsmith Godzilla style alias bar for Magic frames
version: 2026-11-22
depends on:
	package: magic-modules.mse-include
	version: 2024-10-01

# The alias (a card's real name on a reskinned or Godzilla series card) printed in a bar hanging under the
# title bar, like printed Godzilla series cards: a see-through grey plate trimmed in the frame colour, the
# name in white italic. The bar images are the M15 pack's own (magic-modules.mse-include/extras/alias).
# Files:
#   script       alias_bar_key, included in each frame's init script; the frame defines alias_bar_top
#   card_fields  the bar, included at the top level of each frame (tools\make-slim-data.ps1 patches both in)
